[1m[38;5;231mWhich approach should the spec build on?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA — sessionStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mSession module owning userId, persisted per-tab. Fully buildable and testable today; server contract specified for
[39m     [38;5;246ma later move to C.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B — localStorage
     [38;5;246mSame module, survives browser restart. Needs an explicit logout and expiry policy to be safe on shared machines.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C — HttpOnly cookie + /me
     [38;5;246mServer owns the session; client caches in memory only. The correct end state, but needs a backend that does not [39m
     [38;5;246mexist in this repo yet.[39m
